=== domain ls :: $ ployz domain ls
DOMAIN     SERVICE   PORT   STATUS       REASON
acme.com   web       -      setting up   Ployz can't see the Servers right now

=== domain ls --json :: $ ployz domain ls --json
{
  "domains": [
    {
      "action": null,
      "hostname": "acme.com",
      "kind": "custom",
      "port": null,
      "reason": "Ployz can't see the Servers right now",
      "service": "web",
      "status": "setting_up"
    }
  ],
  "environment": {
    "id": "2aff4644-5322-460a-97ec-ec5a24b95fef",
    "name": "production",
    "project": "shop",
    "revision": 13
  }
}

=== domain add, duplicate host :: $ ployz domain add web shop.example.org
Nothing changed in shop/production; shop.example.org is already on web.

=== domain add, unknown service :: $ ployz domain add nosuch
error: No Service named nosuch in Environment production
valid: web, api, postgres, worker, redis

=== domain add, unknown service --json :: $ ployz domain add nosuch --json
{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"not_found","details":{"valid_children":["web","api","postgres","worker","redis"]},"message":"No Service named nosuch in Environment production"}}

=== domain add, bad host :: $ ployz domain add web not\ a\ host
error: Expected a hostname like app.example.com

=== domain set, prefix with a dot :: $ ployz domain set api my.api
error: Expected one DNS label, like shop

=== domain ls after changes :: $ ployz domain ls
DOMAIN                    SERVICE   PORT   STATUS       REASON
acme.com                  web       -      setting up   Ployz can't see the Servers right now
shop.example.org          web       -      setting up   Live after your next deploy
docs.example.org          web       8080   setting up   Live after your next deploy
myapi.ada.ployz.test      api       -      setting up   Live after your next deploy
myworker.ada.ployz.test   worker    -      setting up   Live after your next deploy
next: ployz deploy --project shop

=== domain check acme.com :: $ ployz domain check acme.com
domain   acme.com
service  web
port     -
status   setting up
reason   Ployz can't see the Servers right now

=== domain check acme.com --json :: $ ployz domain check acme.com --json
{
  "domain": {
    "action": null,
    "hostname": "acme.com",
    "kind": "custom",
    "port": null,
    "reason": "Ployz can't see the Servers right now",
    "service": "web",
    "status": "setting_up"
  },
  "environment": {
    "id": "2aff4644-5322-460a-97ec-ec5a24b95fef",
    "name": "production",
    "project": "shop",
    "revision": 19
  }
}

=== domain check unknown :: $ ployz domain check nope.example.org
error: No such domain in Environment production
valid: acme.com, shop.example.org, docs.example.org, myapi.ada.ployz.test, myworker.ada.ployz.test

=== domain rm unknown :: $ ployz domain rm nope.example.org
error: No such domain in Environment production
valid: acme.com, myapi.ada.ployz.test, myworker.ada.ployz.test

=== domain rm unknown --json :: $ ployz domain rm nope.example.org --json
{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"not_found","details":{"valid_children":["acme.com","myapi.ada.ployz.test","myworker.ada.ployz.test"]},"message":"No such domain in Environment production"}}

=== domain ls --project nosuch :: $ ployz domain ls --project nosuch
error: No Project named nosuch

